{"symbol":"AMKAY","yahoo":"AMKAY.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Amkay Products Limited","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Instruments & Supplies","website":"https://amkayproducts.com","about":"Amkay Products Limited manufactures, assembles, and markets a portfolio of medical devices, disposables, and other healthcare products in India. The company offers face masks, alcohol swabs, lancet needles, nebulizers, pulse oximeters, surgeon caps, blood pressure monitors, air bed, adult diapers, hot water bags, HIV kits, bio bags, suction machines, apron gowns, gluco strips, thermometer, vaporizer, ambu bag, fetal dropper, body massager, breast pump, stature meter, bed bath towel, show cover, bed sheet, gloves, lancing pen, prep razor/skin blade, cord clamp, and torniquet, as well as urine pad and bag. It serves medical professionals, retailers, hospitals, prestigious institutes, government bodies, pharmaceutical companies, distributors, and dealers. The company also exports its products to Bhutan, Nepal, and internationally. Amkay Products Limited was incorporated in 2007 and is headquartered in Palghar, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:08:04+00:00","quote":{"price":62.75,"prevClose":63.98,"marketCap":54.32,"high52":81.99,"low52":39.22,"pe":23.5,"bookValue":30.47,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":9.16,"shares":0.8656,"insiders":73.21,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2024-05-08","2024-05-09","2024-05-10","2024-05-13","2024-05-14","2024-05-15","2024-05-16","2024-05-17","2024-05-21","2024-05-22","2024-05-23","2024-05-24","2024-05-27","2024-05-28","2024-05-29","2024-05-30","2024-05-31","2024-06-03","2024-06-04","2024-06-05","2024-06-06","2024-06-07","2024-06-10","2024-06-11","2024-06-12","2024-06-13","2024-06-14","2024-06-18","2024-06-19","2024-06-20","2024-06-21","2024-06-24","2024-06-25","2024-06-26","2024-06-27","2024-06-28","2024-07-01","2024-07-02","2024-07-03","2024-07-04","2024-07-05","2024-07-08","2024-07-09","2024-07-10","2024-07-11","2024-07-12","2024-07-15"